  "html": "<p>워크스페이스의 모든 멤버는 <strong>Owner</strong>, <strong>Editor</strong>, <strong>Viewer</strong> 중 하나의 역할을 가집니다.</p>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"역할-개요\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#역할-개요\" class=\"peer\">역할 개요</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>역할</th><th>설명</th><th>부여 시점</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Owner</strong></td><td>워크스페이스의 모든 권한 보유</td><td>워크스페이스 생성 시 자동 부여 또는 기존 Owner가 지정</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Editor</strong></td><td>워크플로우 편집·실행 가능. 일부 관리 기능 사용</td><td>Owner가 지정</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Viewer</strong></td><td>읽기 전용 접근</td><td>Owner가 지정</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"상세-권한-매트릭스\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#상세-권한-매트릭스\" class=\"peer\">상세 권한 매트릭스</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<h3 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"워크스페이스-관리\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#워크스페이스-관리\" class=\"peer\">워크스페이스 관리</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h3>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>기능</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Owner</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Editor</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Viewer</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>워크스페이스 생성</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅ (생성자=Owner)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">—</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">—</td></tr><tr><td>워크스페이스 정보 수정 (이름/설명)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>워크스페이스 삭제</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅ (조건부)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>워크스페이스 나가기</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"워크플로우-조회실행\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#워크플로우-조회실행\" class=\"peer\">워크플로우 조회/실행</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h3>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>기능</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Owner</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Editor</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Viewer</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>워크플로우 캔버스 보기</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td></tr><tr><td>워크플로우 실행 (Run)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>실행 로그 조회</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"워크플로우-편집\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#워크플로우-편집\" class=\"peer\">워크플로우 편집</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h3>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>기능</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Owner</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Editor</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Viewer</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>블록 추가/삭제/수정</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>블록 연결(엣지) 편집</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>워크플로우 이름/설명 수정</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>워크플로우 생성</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>워크플로우 삭제</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>워크플로우 복제 (Duplicate)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>워크플로우 내보내기 (Export)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>워크플로우 가져오기 (Import)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>워크플로우 삭제는 Owner와 Editor가 할 수 있지만, 워크스페이스에 마지막 하나만 남은 워크플로우는 삭제할 수 없습니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<h3 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"배포-deploy\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#배포-deploy\" class=\"peer\">배포 (Deploy)</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h3>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>기능</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Owner</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Editor</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Viewer</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>배포 실행</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>배포 상태 조회</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td></tr><tr><td>배포 취소/중지</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-warning, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>화면에서 배포 실행과 취소는 <strong>Owner만</strong> 할 수 있습니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<h3 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"설정-리소스\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#설정-리소스\" class=\"peer\">설정 리소스</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h3>\n<p><strong>Settings</strong>에는 <strong>API Keys</strong>, <strong>MCP Servers</strong>, <strong>Files</strong> 메뉴가 있습니다. MCP(Model Context Protocol)는 모델과 외부 도구를 연결하는 표준입니다. 각 메뉴에 표시되는 항목과 사용할 수 있는 관리 작업은 화면에 적용된 권한에 따라 달라집니다.</p>\n<h3 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"멤버-관리\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#멤버-관리\" class=\"peer\">멤버 관리</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h3>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>기능</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Owner</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Editor</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Viewer</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>멤버 목록 조회</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td></tr><tr><td>멤버 초대</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>멤버 역할 변경</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>멤버 제거</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td></tr><tr><td>자발적 탈퇴 (나가기)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">❌</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td><td style=\"text-align:center\">✅</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"역할별-범위-요약\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#역할별-범위-요약\" class=\"peer\">역할별 범위 요약</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>범위</th><th>해당 역할</th><th>적용 기능</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>워크스페이스 관리</td><td>Owner</td><td>워크스페이스 정보 수정·삭제, 배포 실행·중지</td></tr><tr><td>멤버 관리</td><td>Owner</td><td>멤버 초대·역할 변경·제거</td></tr><tr><td>워크플로우 편집</td><td>Owner, Editor</td><td>블록·연결 편집, 워크플로우 생성·수정·삭제</td></tr><tr><td>워크플로우 조회</td><td>Owner, Editor, Viewer</td><td>캔버스·로그·배포 상태 조회</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"역할-변경\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#역할-변경\" class=\"peer\">역할 변경</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Owner만</strong> 다른 멤버의 역할을 변경하거나 제거할 수 있습니다</li>\n<li>역할 변경은 즉시 반영됩니다</li>\n<li>모든 역할 변경은 <a href=\"#/detail/workspace/audit-log\">변경 이력</a>에 기록됩니다</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-warning, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><strong>최소 1명 Owner 보장</strong>: 워크스페이스에 Owner가 1명만 남은 경우, 해당 Owner의 역할 변경이나 제거는 거부됩니다. 다른 멤버를 먼저 Owner로 지정한 후 변경하세요.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"워크스페이스-삭제-조건\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#워크스페이스-삭제-조건\" class=\"peer\">워크스페이스 삭제 조건</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>Owner가 워크스페이스를 삭제하려면 다음 조건을 충족해야 합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>조건</th><th>설명</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>다른 참여자 없음</td><td>Owner 본인만 남아 있어야 합니다</td></tr><tr><td>배포된 워크플로우 없음</td><td>활성 배포 중인 워크플로우가 있으면 먼저 중지해야 합니다</td></tr><tr><td>확인 절차</td><td>워크스페이스 이름을 직접 입력하여 삭제를 확인합니다</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-error, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m15 9-6 6\"></path><path d=\"m9 9 6 6\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>삭제된 워크스페이스와 그 안의 모든 워크플로우는 복구할 수 없습니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<hr/>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"그룹-역할과의-관계\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#그룹-역할과의-관계\" class=\"peer\">그룹 역할과의 관계</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>워크스페이스 역할인 Owner, Editor, Viewer는 그룹원, 그룹관리자, 조직관리자 역할과 별도로 부여됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><strong>이름이 같은 두 가지를 구분하세요.</strong></p><div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>무엇을 정하나</th><th>어디서</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>조직 권한 <strong>워크스페이스 관리</strong></td><td>워크스페이스를 <strong>새로 만들 수 있는가</strong></td><td>조직 &gt; 역할·권한 구성</td></tr><tr><td>워크스페이스 역할 <strong>Owner</strong></td><td>만든 뒤 그 안에서 <strong>무엇을 할 수 있는가</strong></td><td>워크스페이스 멤버 관리</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>조직 권한이 막는 것은 <strong>생성 하나</strong>입니다. 이미 있는 워크스페이스에서의 동작은\n아래 매트릭스대로 Owner · Editor · Viewer 가 정합니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<p>워크스페이스 관리 화면에서는 다음 기준으로 최종 역할을 판단합니다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>조직관리자는 Owner로 처리됩니다.</li>\n<li>워크스페이스가 직접 속한 그룹의 그룹관리자는 직접 Editor 또는 Viewer 역할이 있어도 Owner가 우선합니다.</li>\n<li>상위 그룹의 그룹관리자는 직접 워크스페이스 역할이 없을 때만 Owner로 처리됩니다. 직접 역할이 있으면 해당 역할이 우선합니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>이 기준은 워크스페이스 관리 화면에 적용됩니다. 워크플로우와 테이블 등 개별 기능의 권한을 같은 값으로 간주하지 마세요.</p></div></div></div>"
}